title: "CONCLAVE: agentic AI with an ensemble cognitive core"
abstract: >-
  An agentic AI framework whose cognitive core is a heterogeneous machine-learning
  ensemble rather than a language model, for autonomous systems in
  connectivity-denied and power-constrained environments.
